  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER IDENTIFICATION IN DR. CONGO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project concerns a 9-days Partner Identification trip to Sud-Kivu province in DR Congo. The objective is to identify which organisation has the capacity for a potential project and a genuine interest in creating sustainable change through children and youth activities in their community. The trip will help us to evaluate potential partner?s integrity, organisational structure, target group, track record and state required documents. At the same time we intend to investigate potantial partner organizations&apos; vision, community involvement, woman and youth influence and participation in the organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
